{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05384","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴 · 程行谌","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣主崇文化，锵锵得盛才。\n相因归梦立，殿以集贤开。\n象系微言阐，诗书至道该。\n尧尊承帝泽，禹膳自天来。\n礼洽欢逾长，风恬暑更回。\n国朝将舜颂，同是一康哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"程行谌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}